<title>FRANCE: CADES sets 12 bln Ffr 6 pct 2005 bond, spread 7 bp.</title>
<headline>CADES sets 12 bln Ffr 6 pct 2005 bond, spread 7 bp.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the lead managers.</p>
<p> BORROWER - CADES</p>
<p> LEAD MGR - BNP, CNCA</p>
<p> AMT   12 BLN FRF	 COUPON     6.00	MATURITY 25.JUL.05</p>
<p> TYPE  DOMESTIC	   ISS PRICE  101.399   PAY DATE 14.OCT.96</p>
<p>				REOFFER    99.749    ACCRUAL  14.0CT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  200 BP	YLD/SPREAD 6.033 +7</p>
<p>NOTE - Spread calculated over interpolated yield between 7.5 percent and 7.75 percent 2005 OATs. First coupon will be paid on July 25, but will be 6 percent minus 1.332 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
